{"seq":9,"slug":"data-cleaning-preprocessing","title":"数据清洗与预处理","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":5,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-cleaning-preprocessing","rating":{"composite":3.53,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"数据清洗与预处理\">数据清洗与预处理</h1><p>数据科学界流传着一句话：&quot;数据科学家百分之八十的时间，都花在清洗和准备数据上。&quot;这道出了一个常被忽视却至关重要的真相——再先进的算法、再强大的模型，若喂给它的是杂乱、肮脏、错误的数据，得到的也只能是错误的结果，正所谓&quot;垃圾进，垃圾出&quot;。数据清洗与预处理，正是把原始的、混乱的数据，转化为干净、规整、可用之数据的关键工序。它虽不如建模那般光鲜，却是一切数据分析与机器学习的基石。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向希望理解数据工作之根基的读者，无需深厚的统计或编程背景，系统讲解数据清洗与预处理的核心任务、方法与智慧。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>数据清洗与预处理的基础</strong>阐明真实数据为何&quot;脏&quot;、数据清洗与预处理的含义、以及&quot;垃圾进，垃圾出&quot;这一决定一切数据工作成败的根本原则。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>缺失值的处理</strong>剖析缺失的成因与类型（完全随机/随机/非随机缺失）、删除法的代价与偏差风险、各种填充方法的权衡，以及&quot;缺失本身是信息&quot;的洞察。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>异常值与噪声</strong>考察异常值的二重成因（错误 vs 真实罕见现象）、识别异常的思路，以及处理异常值时&quot;分辨而非一刀切&quot;的微妙判断。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>数据变换与缩放</strong>讲解为何干净的数据仍需调整形态——缩放（标准化、归一化）以消除尺度差异、类别编码以把文字转为数字、以及对数变换等改善分布的手段。</p>\n<p>第五章<strong>数据质量、整合与意义</strong>从全局审视数据质量的多维度、不一致与重复的处理、多源数据整合的挑战，并总结数据清洗作为数据科学&quot;隐形基石&quot;的深远意义与实践智慧，为全篇作结。</p>\n<p>读完本知识库，你将理解数据清洗与预处理的核心任务与方法，并对这项看似平凡、实则决定一切数据工作成败的基础工序，形成应有的重视与务实的态度。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"数据清洗与预处理的基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-cleaning-preprocessing/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-data-is-dirty","title":"真实数据为何\"脏\"","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-cleaning-preprocessing/foundations/why-data-is-dirty"},{"seq":2,"slug":"what-is-cleaning-preprocessing","title":"什么是数据清洗与预处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-cleaning-preprocessing/foundations/what-is-cleaning-preprocessing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"garbage-in-garbage-out","title":"垃圾进，垃圾出","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-cleaning-preprocessing/foundations/garbage-in-garbage-out"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"missing-values","title":"缺失值的处理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-cleaning-preprocessing/missing-values","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"causes-and-types","title":"缺失的成因与类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-cleaning-preprocessing/missing-values/causes-and-types"},{"seq":2,"slug":"deletion-and-imputation","title":"删除与填充","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-cleaning-preprocessing/missing-values/deletion-and-imputation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"missingness-as-information","title":"缺失本身是信息","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-cleaning-preprocessing/missing-values/missingness-as-information"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"outliers-and-noise","title":"异常值与噪声","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-cleaning-preprocessing/outliers-and-noise","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-are-outliers","title":"什么是异常值与噪声","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-cleaning-preprocessing/outliers-and-noise/what-are-outliers"},{"seq":2,"slug":"detecting-outliers","title":"识别异常值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-cleaning-preprocessing/outliers-and-noise/detecting-outliers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"handling-outliers","title":"处理异常值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-cleaning-preprocessing/outliers-and-noise/handling-outliers"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"transformation-and-scaling","title":"数据变换与缩放","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-cleaning-preprocessing/transformation-and-scaling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-transform","title":"为什么要变换与缩放","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-cleaning-preprocessing/transformation-and-scaling/why-transform"},{"seq":2,"slug":"scaling-standardization","title":"缩放与标准化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-cleaning-preprocessing/transformation-and-scaling/scaling-standardization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"encoding-and-transforms","title":"编码与变换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-cleaning-preprocessing/transformation-and-scaling/encoding-and-transforms"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"quality-and-significance","title":"数据质量、整合与意义","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-cleaning-preprocessing/quality-and-significance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-quality-dimensions","title":"数据质量的维度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-cleaning-preprocessing/quality-and-significance/data-quality-dimensions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"inconsistency-and-dedup","title":"不一致与去重","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-cleaning-preprocessing/quality-and-significance/inconsistency-and-dedup"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-integration","title":"多源数据整合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-cleaning-preprocessing/quality-and-significance/data-integration"},{"seq":4,"slug":"significance","title":"数据清洗与预处理的意义与实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-cleaning-preprocessing/quality-and-significance/significance"}]}]}